    <h1>Terms of Service &amp; SMS Terms</h1>
    <p>These terms cover vertictree.com and text messages from {{ site.legalName }} (“Vertic Tree Works,” “we,” “us”), a tree service company in Baton Rouge, Louisiana.</p>

    <h2>Text messaging program</h2>
    <p><strong>Who sends the messages:</strong> {{ site.legalName }}.</p>
    <p><strong>How you opt in:</strong> by checking a text-message consent box in the chat window on this website, or by giving us permission directly. Each box is optional and unchecked until you check it. Opening the chat or sending a message does not sign you up for texts.</p>
    <p><strong>What we send:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Customer care and job messages</strong> (if you agree to these): replies to your questions, estimate scheduling and follow-up, appointment reminders, and updates about your job.</li>
      <li><strong>Promotional messages</strong> (only if you separately agree to these): occasional offers and seasonal reminders about tree service.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Message frequency</strong> varies based on your conversations and jobs with us.</p>
    <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Check your mobile plan for details.</p>
    <p><strong>To opt out,</strong> reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message. We’ll send one message confirming you’re unsubscribed, then no more texts unless you opt in again.</p>
    <p><strong>For help,</strong> reply <strong>HELP</strong>, call <a href="{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Consent to receive texts is not a condition of purchase.</strong> You can get an estimate and hire us without agreeing to texts.</p>
    <p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. How we handle your mobile number is covered in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

